              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji avuze: Ngiye gushira iherezo kuri uwo mwibutsa, ntuzosubira gukoreshwa mu Bisirayeli.’ Genda ubabwire uti: ‘Igihe kiregereje, aho ivyavugishijwe vyose bizoshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
